--","+hello world","+","+# quoted identifiers","+statement ok","+$\"my var\" := 42","+","+query I","+SELECT getvariable('my var')","+----","+42","+","+# RESET still works","+statement ok","+RESET VARIABLE x","+","+statement error","+SELECT $x","+----","+Values were not provided","+","+# the $ is required","+statement error","+x := 5","+----","+syntax error","+","+# only a single value is allowed","+statement error","+$x := 5, 6","+----","+syntax error","+","+statement error","+$x :=","+----","+syntax error","+","+statement error","+$ := 5","+----","+syntax error","+","+statement error","+:= 5","+----","+syntax error","+","+# reserved keywords cannot be variable names","+statement error","+$select := 5","+----","+syntax error","+","+# only := assigns","+statement error","+$x = 5","+----","+syntax error","+","+# named parameters in function calls are unaffected","+statement ok","+PREPARE p AS SELECT $a + $b","+","+query I","+EXECUTE p(a := 1, b := 2)","+----","+3","+","+# multiple assignments in one query string","+statement ok","+$a := 1; $b := 2;","+","+query I","+SELECT $a + $b","+----","+3",""],"additions":163,"deletions":0,"truncated":false}],"additions":248,"deletions":10,"truncated":false,"file_count":10},"error":null,"fetched_at":"2026-10-26T14:32:42.911666+00:00"}